---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Silicon Pen"
  description="Privacy Policy for SiliconPen — how we collect, use, and protect your information, including third-party cookies from Google AdSense."
>
  <main class="page-main container" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <div class="post-content">
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to SiliconPen (“we”, “our”, or “the site”). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit <strong>siliconpen.com</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Anonymous analytics such as pages viewed, time on site, and general device type via Google Analytics.</li>
        <li>Contact information only if voluntarily submitted (such as subscribing to the MailerLite newsletter).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies &amp; Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        SiliconPen uses third-party advertising partners—including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>—which may use cookies to serve personalized advertisements based on user interests.
      </p>
      <p>
        Users can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting: <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">google.com/settings/ads</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our articles include links to datasheets, manufacturer documentation, and external reference materials. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Protection</h2>
      <p>
        We never sell personal information to anyone. We only store subscriber emails for newsletter dispatches and you may unsubscribe at any time with one click.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy inquiries: <a href="mailto:pr.rishi.2764@gmail.com">pr.rishi.2764@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
